{"id":"qwc96of4feakrsnb5y9d8xf93","title":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（158）：寒客","originalTitle":null,"summary":"\"寒客\"是古代文献中蜡梅的雅称，因蜡梅于寒冬开花而得名。宋代姚宽《西溪丛语》首次记载此名，明代李时珍《本草纲目》正式收录，清代《花镜》等花谱亦沿用此称。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1561455"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T02:02:37.612Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T02:02:37.612Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":12,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}